From a015d5c738f87143e27f454a124a838f47773df8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 07:43:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Biometrika qaytarildi: Face ID / Touch ID / barmoq izi bilan
 ilova qulfi
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Sentyabrda `local_auth` Android release buildini R8 bosqichida qotirgani
uchun olib tashlangan edi. Hozirgi toolchain'da (Flutter 3.35.5, AGP
8.9.1, local_auth 3.0.1 / local_auth_android 2.0.8) bu takrorlanmadi:
release APK local_auth bilan 153 s, usiz 190 s.

- pubspec: local_auth ^3.0.1
- Android: MainActivity -> FlutterFragmentActivity (BiometricPrompt
  talabi), USE_BIOMETRIC ruxsati, API darajasi kanali
  (uz.nfcstore.nova/device)
- iOS: NSFaceIDUsageDescription (usiz Face ID oynasi ochilmaydi)
- biometricAvailableProvider: faqat YOZILGAN biometrika bo'lsa va
  Android 9+ / iOS da true; Android < 9 da local_auth hujjatiga ko'ra
  AppCompat bo'lmagan tema bilan qulashi mumkin — u yerda PIN qoladi
- qulf ekrani: biometrika avtomatik taklif qilinadi va barmoq izi
  tugmasi faqat mavjud bo'lsa chiqadi; PIN har doim ishlaydi
- Sozlamalar: biometrika kaliti, mavjud bo'lmasa o'chiq va sababi
  yozilgan (kalit rangi mavzudan — patch 0010 qo'riqchisi)
- testlar: barmoq izi tugmasi bor/yo'q/sozlamada o'chiq (3 ta)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X3fizJ3F3nvfvUZqdZamcq
